      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "两道显式闸门",
      "items": [
        "enable(extensionId)：整个扩展默认不启用，发现≠生效；requireKnownExtension 拒绝未知 ID",
        "exposeTool/allowCommand/allowSkill/allowPrompt/allowGuardrail：能力逐项再授权——扩展声明了不等于宿主放行"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "五类能力注册表",
      "items": [
        "ExtensionContext 暴露 tools()/commands()/skills()/prompts()/guardrails()——apply 里各取所注册表",
        "ask-user 示例一次注册全四类：ask_user 工具 + ask-user 命令 + SKILL.md + prompt 模板（同名 ID 体系）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Manifest 即契约",
      "items": [
        "id/name/version/vendor + capability 集合 + permission + configPrefix——宿主按清单决定展示与配额",
        "ActivationPlan/InspectionSnapshot/RuntimeSnapshot 三层回读：激活项、静态检查、运行时状态都可观测"
      ]
    }
  ]
